    title: "ADR-0049 Lazy-row parity sweep: JPA getResultStream/getReference, sqlite3.Connection.iterdump, NSURLSession task rows -- each moves to db_compose/net_listen only on its own ruling-3 proof (the Django licence does not transfer; SQLAlchemy and Ecto have no rows to move)"  # 1cd3
